5700,"plain":"ELEPHANTS AT SOUTH BANK EAST, STRENGTH 100.","cipher":null},{"seq":903,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1830,"retries":0},{"seq":904,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Kite offered a truce, which is good for defense. My doctrine is to defend F1 and F2. Rhino archers are at Rhino Camp, which supports the defense. I should reinforce the middle ford (F2) and keep cavalry active to patrol between F1 and F2 as per doctrine. The orchid has been activ"},{"seq":905,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c313","house":"rhino","letter":"L387","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west"],"depart":5700,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":906,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c314","house":"rhino","letter":"L388","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":6000,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RANKJS BKKT, DKHS MT IESSHA BKQS."},{"seq":907,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c315","house":"rhino","letter":"L389","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village"],"depart":5700,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":908,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1757,"retries":0},{"seq":909,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Rhino truce is active. Plan is to offer it, then betray it at the last watch. Current focus is maintaining position while preparing for the final betrayal. Kite archers/inf are at F2. Need to position forces for the final push."},{"seq":910,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c316","house":"kite","letter":"L390","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","n-west"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":911,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c317","house":"kite","letter":"L391","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","p